## MAUI / mobile signing artifacts — never commit these
*.pfx
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p8

## Whole folder, not just the keystore file above - the README next to it carries the plaintext
## keystore password, which must never enter git history either.
/signing/

## Firebase config — google-services.json/GoogleService-Info.plist are committed (Google's own
## guidance: they're client-scoped, not secrets — Codemagic clones this repo and needs them at
## build time). A service-account key is a real secret and must never be committed.
*firebase-adminsdk*.json

